**7. Voice food logging**
Spec requires users to speak what they ate to log it. Pro: 10/day limit, Premium: unlimited. Not built — needs Whisper or Claude API.



**10. Sleep tracker**
Manual sleep logging works but Apple Health / Google Fit / smartwatch integration is not built.

**11. Notifications — Push (Firebase)**
The notification service exists in code but Firebase Cloud Messaging is not configured so push notifications don't actually arrive on devices.


**13. App icon and splash screen**
Still using default Expo icon. CalFit branded icon and splash screen needed before store submission.

**14. EAS build configuration**
`eas.json` not yet configured. Needed to generate APK and IPA.

