## What I Recommend We Build Now

In priority order — highest impact first:

1. **Share post to external apps** — quick win, Expo Sharing (DONE)
2. **Kudos notification** — one line fix in post service (DONE)
3. **Recap cards** — high value, users will share these organically (DONE)
4. **Intermittent Fasting screen** — it's in the spec, client will notice it's missing (DONE)
5. **Group real-time chat** — community feature that drives engagement
6. **Progress screen** — wire to real Supabase data
7. **AndroidSafeView** on remaining screens — Android users will have layout issues
8. **App icon and splash screen** — blocks store submission